OL,5,G1500 History's Secret Heroes
OL,6,     F2/11. Marine Herbert Hasler
OL,7,     Fdevises a madcap commando raid on
OL,8,     FGerman ships, using canoes.
OL,9,G1530 Heart and Soul
OL,10,     FDavid Eubank calls himself a
OL,11,     FChristian missionary, not a
OL,12,     Fsoldier. But in the war zones of
OL,13,     FBurma and Iraq, he has rescued the
OL,14,     Fwounded, carried the dead, and
OL,15,     Fkilled.
OL,16,G1600 Beryl Cook: Artist or Entertainer?
OL,17,     FA shy, self-taught, gloriously
OL,18,     Frude seaside landlady. But was she
OL,19,     Fa serious artist? In Beryl Cook's
OL,20,     Fcentenary year, Louisa Buck heads
OL,21,     Fto Plymouth to find out.
